<title>USA: TABLE - Weyerhaeuser Co sells debentures.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Weyerhaeuser Co sells debentures.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from Weyerhaeuser Co was priced on Wedenesday, according to lead Morgan Stanley, Dean Witter, Discover &amp; Co.</p>
<p>Weyerhaeuser is a forest product company.</p>
<p>BORROWER WEYERHAEUSER COMPANY</p>
<p>AMT $300 MLN	 COUPON 6.95 PCT   MATURITY 8/1/2017</p>
<p>TYPE DEBENTURES    ISS PRICE 99.508  FIRST PAY DATE 2/1/998</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S A2    YIELD 6.996 PCT   PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P SINGLE-A  SPREAD +63.5 BPS  CALLABLE NO ((U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212-859-1678))</p>
</text>
